sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>ProjectImages
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>DeleteProjectImageBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>DeleteProjectImageController
  participant StorageService as «control»<br/>StorageService
  participant ProjectImage as «entity»<br/>ProjectImage
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: delete a photo from my IDP
  UI->>B: DELETE /api/designer/projects/{id}/images/{imageId} (JWT)
  B->>C: delete(Integer designerId, Integer projectId, Integer imageId)
  C->>ProjectImage: delete()
  ProjectImage->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>ProjectImage: rows
  ProjectImage-->>C: result
  C->>StorageService: delete()
  StorageService-->>C: result
  C-->>B: void
  B-->>UI: 204 No Content
  UI-->>A: show result